1
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,480
Mommy

2
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,560
You're awake.

3
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:49,040
Are you hungry?

4
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,159
I'm not.

5
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,439
Mommy,

6
00:01:51,879 --> 00:01:54,239
I want to go play with Uncle Liao.

7
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:57,719
Uncle Liao is very busy lately.

8
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,000
He has to protect a lot of people.

9
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:01,840
When he's not busy,

10
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,000
he'll come play with you.

11
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,280
Be good.

12
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,159
Naonao,

13
00:02:11,759 --> 00:02:12,639
go play in your room.

14
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,759
Mommy will come get you in a bit.

15
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,479
Grab your things.

16
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,759
We're leaving now.

17
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,240
What about Lu Haifeng?

18
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,319
Is it handled?

19
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:30,479
It's handled.

20
00:02:30,479 --> 00:02:31,199
I went out for groceries,

21
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:32,400
and someone was watching me.

22
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:41,719
It won't stop us from leaving.

23
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,280
I wasn't wrong, was I?

24
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,319
I told you,

25
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,560
this is his turf.

26
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,599
If you don't fully handle Lu Haifeng,

27
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:02,280
I'm not leaving.

28
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:10,599
Don't cause trouble here.

29
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:15,360
No training today?

30
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,400
Right, Sister Yuan.

31
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:18,000
What can I get you?

32
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,439
I need a nail clipper.

33
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:20,000
Okay.

34
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,719
And four AA batteries.

35
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,360
Batteries. Ten yuan.

36
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,840
What happened to your face?

37
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,360
Scraped it during training.

38
00:03:28,719 --> 00:03:29,639
You have to be careful.

39
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,520
Make sure it doesn't get infected.

40
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,240
It's fine, Sis.

41
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,800
Is Naonao not here?

42
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,840
Naonao is playing in his room.

43
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:41,520
490.

44
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:44,000
491.

45
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,960
492.

46
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,680
493.

47
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:56,000
494.

48
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,199
Hold on.

49
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,599
Almost done.

50
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,280
495.

51
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,919
496.

52
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,800
497.

53
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,960
498.

54
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,000
99.

55
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,680
Don't touch me.

56
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,800
500, not one less.

57
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,199
500.

58
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,360
Back in the day,

59
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,120
doing two hundred a set,

60
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,120
I could do three sets in a row,

61
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:06,439
and still run three kilometers.

62
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,399
But look at me now.

63
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,680
Just five hundred push-ups,

64
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,560
and I'm panting like this.

65
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:17,399
You were right before.

66
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:20,199
I just spent too much time with the traffic police.

67
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:21,639
I'm out of practice.

68
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,680
Our Special Police Unit is different.

69
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,480
You need to be in top shape

70
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:29,959
and ready to fight hard.

71
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,000
But then again,

72
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,199
who can keep fighting hard their whole life?

73
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,560
Out of our batch that joined back then,

74
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,199
only the two of us are left now.

75
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,920
As for the others...

76
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,480
When the time came,

77
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,920
some took reassignment,

78
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:52,079
and some transferred to logistics.

79
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,839
We know very well

80
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,000
it's not that they didn't want to stay,

81
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,680
they really just couldn't do it anymore.

82
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:07,079
What exactly are you trying to say?

83
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,279
Just spit it out.

84
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,639
What's up?

85
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:28,600
Brother Lang,

86
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,120
About Ma'am coming today...

87
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,120
Listen to me.

88
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:35,199
Ma'am is just a bit outspoken.

89
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:37,120
She means no harm, you know?

90
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,600
Just watch me when I get back today.

91
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,560
I'll teach her a good lesson.

92
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,399
She's totally out of line.

93
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,240
You'll understand once you get married.

94
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,800
I'll give you proper training when the time comes.

95
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:47,240
When dealing with your wife,

96
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:48,920
you need to be accommodating,

97
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:51,040
but also know the limit.

98
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,600
You can't spoil her.

99
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,720
Understand?

100
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,079
What do you think about the reassignment?

101
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,160
Commissar Tan told me about it.

102
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,519
I don't agree with it.

103
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:09,720
What do you think?

104
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,680
Boss, were you tired from the push-ups just now?

105
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:18,519
Doing 500 push-ups in one go,

106
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:19,000
how could anyone not be tired?

107
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,680
I'm not tired.

108
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,399
Well, you're young.

109
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,199
Exactly.

110
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,079
Brother Lang,

111
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,360
you have to admit you're getting old.

112
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,240
I refuse to.

113
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,879
I'm still going strong.

114
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:35,680
What?

115
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,120
Hit me.

116
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,160
My muscles are still here.

117
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,600
You kidding me?

118
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:53,680
What do you mean?

119
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,079
You want me reassigned too, don't you?

120
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:12,639
Go home and enjoy your time off.

121
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,959
Get ready for reassignment.

122
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,360
No need to see me out.

123
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,720
Go back and spend some time with Da Zhuang.

124
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,519
Get me something to drink.

125
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:18,879
I'll pass on the alcohol.

126
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:21,360
Right, you have rules to follow.

127
00:09:21,799 --> 00:09:22,720
I'll have this can then.

128
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Something on your mind?

129
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,320
No.

130
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,720
Naonao went to bed early for a change.

131
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,600
I'm just having a drink to unwind.

132
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,679
You're the one with something on your mind, right?

133
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:25,639
You were just standing there alone for quite a while.

134
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,440
It's nothing, really.

135
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,440
Lao Liu left the Special Police Unit.

136
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:53,679
All good things must come to an end.

137
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:55,840
In life,

138
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:58,000
people come and go.

139
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:00,159
It's perfectly normal.

140
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,120
Don't be too sad about it.

141
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,200
It's not that I'm sad, really.

142
00:11:13,279 --> 00:11:14,840
When he was seconded before,

143
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,320
I didn't think much of it.

144
00:11:18,679 --> 00:11:20,480
Because I knew he'd be back eventually.

145
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,080
But this time,

146
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,120
he's really gone.

147
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,360
I'm just not used to it.

148
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,679
That's just how people are.

149
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,919
Just like Naonao.

150
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:49,440
He's gotten used to having you around.

151
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,279
If one day he could never see you again,

152
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:55,240
there's no telling how sad he'd be.

153
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,440
Are you and Naonao moving away?

154
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,240
No, just giving an example.

155
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:15,720
I really like Naonao.

156
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,720
He likes you too.

157
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:33,799
So, what are your plans for you and Naonao?

158
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,240
As for the future,

159
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:46,480
no one can say for sure.

160
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,679
All I can do right now

161
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:53,240
is try my best

162
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:57,000
to be there for him.

163
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,080
As long as he's

164
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:01,600
healthy

165
00:13:02,559 --> 00:13:03,120
and happy,

166
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:03,960
that's all that matters.

167
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:12,879
Being there

168
00:13:17,759 --> 00:13:18,879
is indeed very important.

169
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:43,080
What counts as a good dad?

170
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,480
Spending plenty of quality time.

171
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:47,039
Then what counts as quality time?

172
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:50,559
Taking us to the amusement park.

173
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,960
Or the zoo.

174
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:53,960
Joining in some family activities.

175
00:13:54,799 --> 00:13:55,879
Things like that, I guess.

176
00:13:56,559 --> 00:13:59,240
Naonao's special trust in you is key.

177
00:13:59,679 --> 00:14:00,440
Deep down,

178
00:14:00,679 --> 00:14:02,360
he's missing a father figure.

179
00:14:02,759 --> 00:14:03,399
To put it simply,

180
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:05,039
you just need to fill

181
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:05,840
that fatherly role for him.

182
00:14:06,279 --> 00:14:07,279
Talk to him more.

183
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,759
Show him you care.

184
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,399
Just play with him a bit more.

185
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:12,759
Alright then.

186
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:14,879
Playing, I can do.

187
00:14:55,919 --> 00:14:57,360
Folding my blanket again?

188
00:14:57,919 --> 00:14:58,840
No problem, Commissar.

189
00:14:58,919 --> 00:14:59,759
It's no trouble at all.

190
00:15:03,879 --> 00:15:05,240
Are these flowers pretty?

191
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:08,360
They look nice.

192
00:15:10,879 --> 00:15:11,720
Would they be suitable

193
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,360
to put on your Chief Ji's desk?

194
00:15:27,559 --> 00:15:28,679
Commissar Tan had me bring these over.

195
00:15:29,039 --> 00:15:30,399
He said these flowers are refreshing

196
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,919
and will put you in a good mood.

197
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:39,320
Take them away.

198
00:15:49,759 --> 00:15:51,399
Forget it. Just leave it here.

199
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:52,240
Yes, sir.

200
00:15:54,159 --> 00:15:55,320
Keep memorizing the regulations.

201
00:15:55,519 --> 00:15:55,960
Yes, sir.

202
00:16:12,159 --> 00:16:13,320
Chief Liao, you wanted to see us?

203
00:16:16,559 --> 00:16:18,120
This weekend, you two take Naonao

204
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,320
to the amusement park.

205
00:16:20,399 --> 00:16:20,720
The two of us?

206
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,279
Ms. Chen said for Naonao's mental issues,

207
00:16:24,759 --> 00:16:26,080
counseling is one aspect.

208
00:16:26,399 --> 00:16:28,039
He also needs to get out and play more.

209
00:16:29,399 --> 00:16:30,639
I have plans this weekend.

210
00:16:31,559 --> 00:16:32,159
What plans?

211
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:34,120
I'm going off-roading with my car club.

212
00:16:34,159 --> 00:16:34,720
Then cancel them.

213
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:39,279
You should be the one to go, Chief Liao.

214
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:41,960
I'm on duty. I can't.

215
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:42,960
I'll swap shifts with you.

216
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,720
The kid is close to you.

217
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,399
It'd be better if you went instead.

218
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,279
And invite Boss Yuan.

219
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,240
Create a family atmosphere.

220
00:16:51,039 --> 00:16:52,279
That's what Naonao lacks the most.

221
00:16:53,039 --> 00:16:54,480
A neat little family of three,

222
00:16:55,159 --> 00:16:55,919
strolling in the park,

223
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,519
rowing a boat,

224
00:16:57,919 --> 00:16:59,080
riding the Ferris wheel.

225
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:01,039
Once he's happy, he'll get better.

226
00:17:01,039 --> 00:17:02,240
I think the Commissar is absolutely right.

227
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:05,000
It definitely wouldn't be as good if we went.

228
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:11,599
Take my car.

229
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,319
Aren't you going to the car club?

230
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:14,960
I have another one.

231
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,599
I know a really fun attraction.

232
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:20,000
Let me find it for you. We've been there.

233
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,880
Once you have a family, your temper just vanishes.

234
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,400
This is the one.

235
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:54,720
Naonao.

236
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:55,720
I'm here.

237
00:17:57,319 --> 00:17:57,880
Are you drawing?

238
00:17:59,359 --> 00:17:59,680
Who's this?

239
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,400
This is Mommy.

240
00:18:01,799 --> 00:18:02,839
This is Naonao.

241
00:18:03,759 --> 00:18:04,319
That's Daddy.

242
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,039
And this is you.

243
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,559
Uncle Liao has a small face.

244
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:16,119
But you drew it big and round.

245
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:18,119
No training today?

246
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:19,039
Right.

247
00:18:19,559 --> 00:18:20,160
I'm off today.

248
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:24,759
Hasn't Naonao wanted to go to the park?

249
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:25,480
I'll take him there.

250
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,359
I want to go to the amusement park!

251
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,640
I want to play at the amusement park!

252
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,319
How about we...

253
00:18:28,319 --> 00:18:29,079
That's great.

254
00:18:29,119 --> 00:18:30,599
Because I'm tied up with the shop.

255
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,880
And I trust you to take him out.

256
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,039
Uncle Liao.

257
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,599
Are we going right now?

258
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:37,359
Yeah!

259
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:38,079
Let's go.

260
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:41,279
Wait a minute.

261
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,559
Take his cup with you.

262
00:18:43,559 --> 00:18:44,480
Remember to make him drink water.

263
00:18:44,519 --> 00:18:45,880
And if his heart acts up,

264
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:46,799
give him one of these pills.

265
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:47,319
Okay.

266
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,400
Don't let him have chewing gum.

267
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:48,839
Don't worry.

268
00:18:48,839 --> 00:18:51,200
He can't go on intense high rides.

269
00:18:52,079 --> 00:18:52,599
Naonao.

270
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:54,400
Listen to Uncle Liao, okay?

271
00:18:54,519 --> 00:18:55,359
No running around.

272
00:18:56,119 --> 00:18:57,000
Uncle Liao,

273
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:00,400
can Mom come with us?

274
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,279
Of course she can.

275
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:05,359
Come along with us.

276
00:19:06,279 --> 00:19:07,359
I can't leave the shop.

277
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:10,880
Just close the shop for half a day.

278
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,240
We'll buy more later.

279
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:15,240
Alright.

280
00:19:16,119 --> 00:19:16,960
Let me pack up.

281
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:17,279
Okay.

282
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,000
Get the car ready.

283
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,200
I'm so dizzy.

284
00:20:33,759 --> 00:20:34,319
Are you having fun?

285
00:20:34,839 --> 00:20:35,359
I am!

286
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:35,839
I am!

287
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:37,880
What else do you want to play?

288
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:39,039
Guns!

289
00:20:39,119 --> 00:20:41,279
I want to shoot bad guys like Uncle Liao.

290
00:20:41,599 --> 00:20:42,240
Shoot bad guys! Shoot guns!

291
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:42,880
Let's go shoot some guns.

292
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,839
You guys go ahead. I'll go buy some water.

293
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:50,200
Okay.

294
00:20:51,319 --> 00:20:52,200
Excuse me, how does this work?

295
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,799
Two yuan a shot.

296
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,240
Ten shots minimum.

297
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:56,640
Uncle Liao!

298
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:57,480
Look!

299
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,160
You like that gun?

300
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:00,799
That gun...

301
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,000
...isn't easy to get.

302
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,400
You have to hit 50 shots in a row...

303
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,799
...to win that gun.

304
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:07,559
You can't miss a single one, got it?

305
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,039
Give me 50 shots.

306
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:10,839
Okay.

307
00:21:11,319 --> 00:21:11,960
50 shots.

308
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:12,440
Just a moment.

309
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,480
Here are your 50 shots.

310
00:21:15,759 --> 00:21:16,640
I'll give you five extra.

311
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,839
Thanks, man. Here, hold this.

312
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,559
Shoot!

313
00:21:20,319 --> 00:21:21,519
29.

314
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:23,119
30.

315
00:21:25,319 --> 00:21:26,319
31.

316
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:27,279
32.

317
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,519
33.

318
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:49,519
I wanted to buy you cotton candy earlier.

319
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:51,119
I know you love it.

320
00:21:51,359 --> 00:21:52,839
Too many people, and I'd have to wait in line.

321
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,559
I see Naonao is having a great time.

322
00:21:57,559 --> 00:21:58,119
Of course.

323
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:02,880
Don't let him drink so much of

324
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:03,880
this junk anymore.

325
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,359
Have you picked out the three kids yet?

326
00:22:13,559 --> 00:22:14,720
I'm not going to choose.

327
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:18,400
Didn't we have a deal?

328
00:22:19,279 --> 00:22:20,680
Don't feel guilty about it.

329
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:22,039
Just make your choice.

330
00:22:22,559 --> 00:22:24,079
I'll take care of the rest.

331
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:30,079
Did you deal with those two?

332
00:22:32,119 --> 00:22:32,559
That doesn't matter.

333
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:35,640
I'm a legitimate businessman.

334
00:22:36,559 --> 00:22:37,759
I never do anything illegal.

335
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:40,480
I just had some people talk to them,

336
00:22:41,039 --> 00:22:41,799
to tell them

337
00:22:42,839 --> 00:22:44,319
if they want to take someone from me,

338
00:22:45,599 --> 00:22:46,279
they can forget about it.

339
00:22:46,279 --> 00:22:47,279
You're pretty confident.

340
00:22:48,079 --> 00:22:48,599
You don't believe me?

341
00:22:49,599 --> 00:22:49,759
Here.

342
00:22:51,319 --> 00:22:51,559
Take it.

343
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:53,880
Give those two a call.

344
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:54,799
Ask them

345
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:57,720
if you can actually leave.

346
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:58,960
Deal with them first,

347
00:22:59,039 --> 00:22:59,839
then come talk to me.

348
00:23:04,759 --> 00:23:05,960
I know what you're thinking.

349
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:09,039
You just want to watch me fight them.

350
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,720
But you've overlooked one thing.

351
00:23:13,319 --> 00:23:14,559
No matter which of us

352
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:16,240
wins,

353
00:23:17,359 --> 00:23:18,279
you're not leaving.

354
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:31,920
And another thing,

355
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:34,759
don't you think

356
00:23:34,759 --> 00:23:36,799
dating a Special Police Unit captain

357
00:23:36,799 --> 00:23:37,599
makes you safe.

358
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,000
Does he know your past?

359
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:40,880
Or understand your present?

360
00:23:40,880 --> 00:23:41,559
You're overthinking this.

361
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:48,799
What I think isn't important.

362
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,880
What matters is what you think.

363
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,279
Keep a clear head.

364
00:23:59,759 --> 00:24:01,480
Only I can give you what you want.

365
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,839
Can you even give me what I want?

366
00:24:08,279 --> 00:24:09,319
Fair point.

367
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:12,240
You don't have to think about yourself,

368
00:24:15,079 --> 00:24:16,160
but you need to consider Naonao.

369
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,079
The order has been placed.

370
00:24:25,079 --> 00:24:26,279
But it's taking too long to serve.

371
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,160
Some people are getting impatient.

372
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,000
I can wait.

373
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:31,599
But the others can't.

374
00:24:31,599 --> 00:24:32,319
That's your problem.

375
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:39,079
This is my last warning to you,

376
00:24:39,079 --> 00:24:40,279
and my final piece of advice.

377
00:24:41,160 --> 00:24:42,480
You'd better think this through.

378
00:24:43,799 --> 00:24:44,680
Figure it out.

379
00:24:45,759 --> 00:24:46,680
When you've finally understood,

380
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:48,119
and come back to help me willingly,

381
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:50,599
that will be the best outcome.

382
00:24:53,039 --> 00:24:54,839
A person's patience has limits.

383
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:56,400
I'm begging you,

384
00:24:57,519 --> 00:24:59,400
please don't wear it out, okay?

385
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,480
You know the consequences.

386
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:11,480
Here you go.

387
00:25:12,279 --> 00:25:14,440
Uncle Liao will adjust the scope for you first.

388
00:25:30,279 --> 00:25:31,200
Uncle Liao

389
00:25:31,519 --> 00:25:33,480
Can you see clearly through the scope?

390
00:25:35,279 --> 00:25:36,039
Here, take a look.

391
00:25:36,119 --> 00:25:37,079
It's very clear now.

392
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:49,119
Be a man. Right, pull hard, pull hard.

393
00:25:50,359 --> 00:25:50,759
Is it ready?

394
00:25:51,279 --> 00:25:51,759
Here.

395
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:53,200
Thank you.

396
00:25:56,359 --> 00:25:57,240
Ran into someone you know?

397
00:26:05,519 --> 00:26:06,680
I've seen him before.

398
00:26:07,559 --> 00:26:08,559
The boss of Elite Club.

399
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:11,720
Ex-husband.

400
00:26:19,799 --> 00:26:20,640
Naonao's father.

401
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,400
Bad father.

402
00:26:26,079 --> 00:26:27,200
It's all in the past.

403
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:30,400
Naonao and I have nothing to do with him now.

404
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:38,880
Wanna keep shooting? Come on, take another shot.

405
00:26:40,279 --> 00:26:42,640
Mom, I want some cola too.

406
00:26:42,759 --> 00:26:43,160
No.

407
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,599
Drinking cola will rot kids' teeth.

408
00:26:45,599 --> 00:26:46,880
No, a little bit is fine. It's fine.

409
00:26:47,599 --> 00:26:48,480
I grew up drinking it.

410
00:26:51,039 --> 00:26:51,559
Is it good?

411
00:26:51,759 --> 00:26:52,319
It's good.

412
00:26:52,559 --> 00:26:53,160
Do you want more?

413
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:55,680
I don't want any more.

414
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:29,319
Still not picking up.

415
00:27:40,359 --> 00:27:41,400
That can't be right.

416
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:44,680
Pei Laosan doesn't have the guts.

417
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:50,960
Which means...

418
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:53,240
...something happened.

419
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:20,079
No.

420
00:28:23,839 --> 00:28:24,559
Pei Laosan.

421
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:09,920
Who did this?

422
00:29:14,599 --> 00:29:15,039
I don't know.

423
00:29:16,400 --> 00:29:17,160
Or are you too scared to say?

424
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:29,319
Lu Haifeng.

425
00:29:33,519 --> 00:29:36,000
He told all the boatmen in Hongye.

426
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:36,759
He said

427
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:38,279
you can leave,

428
00:29:38,279 --> 00:29:39,519
but you can't bring anyone extra.

429
00:29:39,519 --> 00:29:40,480
What am I supposed to do?

430
00:29:44,079 --> 00:29:44,640
Pei Laosan,

431
00:29:45,319 --> 00:29:46,440
go prepare some food.

432
00:29:47,839 --> 00:29:48,759
Enough for four.

433
00:29:52,720 --> 00:29:53,799
Four people, Boss?

434
00:29:55,039 --> 00:29:56,920
They said if you take an extra person,

435
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,599
my family will lose someone.

436
00:30:09,119 --> 00:30:09,440
Get up.

437
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:14,559
Don't worry.

438
00:30:16,079 --> 00:30:18,319
We'll teach Lu Haifeng a lesson.

439
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:21,079
Get the stuff ready.

440
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:29,400
That place last night was pretty nice.

441
00:30:29,599 --> 00:30:30,200
Where did you find it?

442
00:30:31,039 --> 00:30:31,559
Are we going again tonight?

443
00:30:34,039 --> 00:30:34,759
That's enough.

444
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:41,759
Elite Club!

445
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,039
Pay our wages!

446
00:30:43,119 --> 00:30:44,039
Elite Club!

447
00:30:44,079 --> 00:30:45,279
Pay our wages!

448
00:30:45,279 --> 00:30:46,200
Elite Club!

449
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:47,440
Pay our wages!

450
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:47,839
Elite Club!

451
00:30:47,839 --> 00:30:49,400
Call the manager! Hurry, call the manager!

452
00:30:49,759 --> 00:30:50,880
Pay our wages!

453
00:30:51,039 --> 00:30:52,160
Elite Club!

454
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,240
Pay our wages!

455
00:30:53,359 --> 00:30:54,880
Pay our wages!

456
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:55,480
Elite!

457
00:30:55,599 --> 00:30:56,400
Pay up!

458
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,440
Pay up!

459
00:30:57,799 --> 00:30:58,599
Elite!

460
00:30:58,920 --> 00:30:59,759
Pay up!

461
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:11,319
Boss Lu.

462
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:13,519
Workers are at the door for a wage claim.

463
00:31:13,559 --> 00:31:14,440
They refuse to leave no matter what.

464
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:17,240
This is ruining our club's image.

465
00:31:19,039 --> 00:31:21,440
Take the wage claim to the decor company?

466
00:31:21,839 --> 00:31:22,640
Why come to us?

467
00:31:23,359 --> 00:31:24,160
Didn't you make that clear to them?

468
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:25,160
I did.

469
00:31:26,160 --> 00:31:27,680
I don't know where they heard it from,

470
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:29,880
they say we haven't paid the decorators.

471
00:31:31,119 --> 00:31:32,119
That's a matter between the club

472
00:31:32,519 --> 00:31:33,920
and the decorators.

473
00:31:34,079 --> 00:31:34,880
We don't have

474
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:36,680
a labor relationship with them.

475
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:39,119
They can't reach the decorators.

476
00:31:39,119 --> 00:31:40,200
They say the boss ran off.

477
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:41,640
They can't get their wages,

478
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:43,079
so they all swarmed over here.

479
00:32:17,359 --> 00:32:18,920
They've made enough of a scene.

480
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:31,599
It's our turn.

481
00:32:49,200 --> 00:32:50,759
Should we give the leader some cash?

482
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:51,960
Once the leader stops making a fuss,

483
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,599
the rest will probably just disperse.

484
00:32:54,359 --> 00:32:55,039
What do you think?

485
00:32:58,799 --> 00:32:59,920
How many people are down there?

486
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:01,839
They've been arriving one after another.

487
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,119
There must be fifty or sixty of them by now.

488
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:06,279
There's no need to settle this privately.

489
00:33:07,559 --> 00:33:07,960
Call the police.

490
00:33:08,839 --> 00:33:09,519
Call the police?

491
00:33:09,599 --> 00:33:10,880
We are legitimate businessmen.

492
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,519
We pay so much in taxes every year.

493
00:33:12,519 --> 00:33:13,960
Now that our legal rights are being violated,

494
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:16,279
the police should protect us.

495
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:32,960
Article 16

496
00:33:33,240 --> 00:33:34,039
Public security officers

497
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:37,119
must accept public reports 24 hours a day.

498
00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:39,960
If a citizen's personal or property safety

499
00:33:40,039 --> 00:33:41,000
is violated,

500
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:44,400
or when they are in other perilous situations,

501
00:33:44,640 --> 00:33:46,359
immediate assistance must be provided.

502
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:51,839
Go on, I'm listening.

503
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:54,799
Regarding citizens' requests to resolve disputes,

504
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,000
assistance must be provided.

505
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:58,160
For cases reported by citizens,

506
00:33:58,480 --> 00:34:00,640
they must be handled promptly and properly.

507
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:03,400
Officers must actively participate

508
00:34:03,839 --> 00:34:06,039
in rescue operations and public welfare activities.

509
00:34:07,279 --> 00:34:08,000
Article 17

510
00:34:08,559 --> 00:34:10,280
In duty, public security officers

511
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,840
must not engage in the following behaviors.

512
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:13,920
Two. Public security officers...

513
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:14,400
Chief Ji,

514
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:15,880
a call came in from the dispatch center.

515
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:17,320
They said that at Elite Club on Bar Street,

516
00:34:17,400 --> 00:34:18,760
a mass wage claim incident occurred.

517
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:20,039
They want us to send people there now.

518
00:34:21,519 --> 00:34:22,800
Notify all officers on duty.

519
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:23,880
Call back those on leave too.

520
00:34:24,239 --> 00:34:24,840
Head to Bar Street.

521
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:25,360
Yes, sir.

522
00:34:31,119 --> 00:34:32,679
Quiet! Please be quiet!

523
00:34:32,679 --> 00:34:33,679
Quiet down!

524
00:34:33,679 --> 00:34:34,480
Quiet down!

525
00:34:35,199 --> 00:34:36,679
We understand the situation.

526
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:38,840
The decorators owe you your wages,

527
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:39,960
not Elite Club.

528
00:34:40,559 --> 00:34:41,559
Go home for now.

529
00:34:42,079 --> 00:34:43,480
We will use legal channels

530
00:34:43,639 --> 00:34:44,360
to help with your wage claim.

531
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:45,320
Don't listen to her!

532
00:34:45,599 --> 00:34:47,119
We won't get paid without a scene today!

533
00:34:47,119 --> 00:34:48,000
You are all police officers,

534
00:34:48,079 --> 00:34:49,559
why won't you get justice for us?

535
00:34:49,599 --> 00:34:51,000
Don't listen to them! Demand the money from him!

536
00:34:54,559 --> 00:34:56,519
Calm down! Step back! Step back!

537
00:34:59,119 --> 00:34:59,679
Li Zhi!

538
00:35:00,239 --> 00:35:01,760
Call the municipal bureau for backup now!

539
00:35:15,159 --> 00:35:16,480
Attention all! Dress right, dress!

540
00:35:18,519 --> 00:35:19,079
Ready, front!

541
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:20,159
At ease!

542
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:21,199
Attention!

543
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:23,679
Orders from the Bureau Command Center.

544
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:26,400
A mass wage claim protest hit Bar Street.

545
00:35:26,719 --> 00:35:27,559
The wage claimants

546
00:35:27,880 --> 00:35:29,480
and onlookers number over a hundred,

547
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:31,840
causing severe traffic congestion

548
00:35:32,320 --> 00:35:33,119
and security risks.

549
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:34,760
Our mission this time

550
00:35:35,199 --> 00:35:36,119
is primarily

551
00:35:36,320 --> 00:35:38,960
to ensure no major conflicts break out.

552
00:35:40,599 --> 00:35:41,039
Understood?

553
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:42,199
Understood!

554
00:35:42,719 --> 00:35:43,920
Let me emphasize this.

555
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:46,280
No matter how the situation escalates,

556
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:48,679
you must not strike back if hit,

557
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:50,079
or curse back if insulted.

558
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:53,920
The safety of the people is our top priority.

559
00:35:54,599 --> 00:35:55,400
Yes, sir!

560
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:57,519
Remember Commissar Tan's words.

561
00:35:57,880 --> 00:36:00,519
The safety of the people is our top priority.

562
00:36:02,199 --> 00:36:03,199
But make sure to protect yourselves as well.

563
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:04,159
Yes, sir!

564
00:36:04,719 --> 00:36:05,039
Move out!

565
00:36:20,519 --> 00:36:21,880
Mom, Mom!

566
00:36:22,239 --> 00:36:23,000
Look!

567
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:25,719
Uncle Liao is driving the Sabertooth!

568
00:36:25,880 --> 00:36:27,239
It's so cool!

569
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,960
Naonao even knows about the Sabertooth?

570
00:36:34,599 --> 00:36:36,320
Uncle Liao told me.

571
00:36:37,199 --> 00:36:37,920
Mom,

572
00:36:38,480 --> 00:36:41,480
when I grow up, can I be a police officer

573
00:36:41,599 --> 00:36:43,000
and drive the Sabertooth?

574
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:48,239
Of course you can.

575
00:36:48,679 --> 00:36:49,519
You're the best, Naonao.

576
00:36:54,280 --> 00:36:56,360
Boss Lu, the police called several times.

577
00:36:56,480 --> 00:36:57,360
They hope you can step forward

578
00:36:57,360 --> 00:36:58,880
and explain things to the workers.

579
00:36:59,400 --> 00:36:59,840
What do you think?

580
00:37:02,639 --> 00:37:03,679
If I go out now

581
00:37:04,679 --> 00:37:05,719
and things really get out of hand,

582
00:37:06,719 --> 00:37:09,000
those officers won't be able to stop them.

583
00:37:09,559 --> 00:37:10,119
Tell them

584
00:37:11,679 --> 00:37:13,360
that I'm concerned about my safety.

585
00:37:15,679 --> 00:37:16,760
The situation is out of control,

586
00:37:18,559 --> 00:37:19,400
so I won't be making an appearance.

587
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,039
Understood, Boss Lu.

588
00:37:35,639 --> 00:37:36,480
Figured it out.

589
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:38,440
Lu Haifeng's office is on the fourth floor.

590
00:37:39,079 --> 00:37:39,880
The one at the end of the hall.

591
00:37:50,719 --> 00:37:52,199
Step back! Back up!

592
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:02,800
Everyone, calm down!

593
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:03,880
Everyone, calm down!

594
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:06,159
Step back! Step back!

595
00:38:07,159 --> 00:38:08,960
Evacuate the outer crowd first.

596
00:38:10,119 --> 00:38:10,800
Listen to me.

597
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:14,280
Hello, everyone.

598
00:38:14,679 --> 00:38:15,559
Pay us back!

599
00:38:16,639 --> 00:38:17,360
Hello, everyone.

600
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:18,920
Give us our hard-earned money!

601
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,960
I'm the Hongye City

602
00:38:21,079 --> 00:38:23,159
Special Police Unit Commissar Tan.

603
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:25,039
Can you just hear me out?

604
00:38:25,159 --> 00:38:26,320
Hear me out.

605
00:38:27,199 --> 00:38:28,079
I don't need this.

606
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:31,400
Wage claims are a labor dispute.

607
00:38:31,920 --> 00:38:35,880
We called the Labor Relations Office.

608
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:38,559
We've invited them here to work on-site.

609
00:38:39,079 --> 00:38:41,039
To express your demands,

610
00:38:41,559 --> 00:38:43,599
please don't use such an emotional,

611
00:38:43,760 --> 00:38:45,199
agitated approach

612
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:46,800
to claim your wages.

613
00:38:47,519 --> 00:38:49,280
What's our goal here?

614
00:38:49,519 --> 00:38:50,719
To get our hard-earned money!

615
00:38:52,119 --> 00:38:52,639
Exactly.

616
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:57,519
With so many of you talking, it's confusing.

617
00:38:57,800 --> 00:38:58,639
Send some representatives.

618
00:38:59,079 --> 00:39:00,239
Pick your representatives,

619
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:01,320
all right?

620
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:02,519
Calm down.

621
00:39:03,079 --> 00:39:05,599
Only by staying calm can you be heard clearly.

622
00:39:05,679 --> 00:39:06,719
Excuse me, coming through.

623
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:07,440
Excuse me, coming through.

624
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:08,480
Sorry, coming through.

625
00:39:08,480 --> 00:39:08,840
Sorry. Sorry.

626
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:10,079
Step back! Step back!

627
00:39:10,199 --> 00:39:10,599
What's going on?

628
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:11,400
Officer!

629
00:39:11,880 --> 00:39:12,800
Can you let us in?

630
00:39:13,159 --> 00:39:14,320
We're all from the same company.

631
00:39:14,559 --> 00:39:15,679
We agreed to demand the money together.

632
00:39:15,920 --> 00:39:16,679
We're just late.

633
00:39:16,840 --> 00:39:17,639
Which company are you from?

634
00:39:17,840 --> 00:39:18,559
Luxury Home Decoration.

635
00:39:20,039 --> 00:39:20,639
Where's your boss?

636
00:39:21,119 --> 00:39:21,719
He ran away.

637
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,039
We renovated Elite Club.

638
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:24,559
We can only come here for our money.

639
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:39,800
How many from the Special Police Unit are here?

640
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:41,119
Quite a few. There are several cars.

641
00:39:41,679 --> 00:39:43,639
Have someone check the lobby and private rooms

642
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:44,800
once again.

643
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:45,920
The special police are here. It's not worth it.

644
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:46,920
Don't let the troublemaking workers sneak in.

645
00:39:46,920 --> 00:39:47,920
Come back another day.

646
00:39:55,159 --> 00:39:55,679
You know how to do it, right?

647
00:39:56,480 --> 00:39:57,000
A little.

648
00:39:58,320 --> 00:39:58,920
Commissar Tan.

649
00:39:59,280 --> 00:39:59,960
You're finally here.

650
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:01,480
As for today's situation,

651
00:40:01,480 --> 00:40:02,159
I really had no idea.

652
00:40:02,159 --> 00:40:03,519
Pay up! Pay up! Pay up!

653
00:40:03,960 --> 00:40:05,719
They completely surrounded my club.

654
00:40:06,159 --> 00:40:07,159
I can't even do business.

655
00:40:07,159 --> 00:40:09,440
They're here with a wage claim for you.

656
00:40:09,840 --> 00:40:11,559
I know, but the ones who owe them wages

657
00:40:11,559 --> 00:40:12,880
is their company's boss.

658
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:14,199
It has nothing to do with me.

659
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:17,039
Look, this is quite complicated.

660
00:40:17,199 --> 00:40:18,079
Let's go inside to talk, alright?

661
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:20,199
No need to go inside for this.

662
00:40:21,239 --> 00:40:23,800
When the Labor Relations Office people arrive later,

663
00:40:24,000 --> 00:40:24,639
along with the wage claim representatives,

664
00:40:24,639 --> 00:40:27,079
the three parties can resolve this.

665
00:40:29,400 --> 00:40:30,920
It's not easy for them.

666
00:40:31,079 --> 00:40:32,159
Give us our hard-earned money back!

667
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,400
Elite Club owes us money and won't pay!

668
00:40:34,559 --> 00:40:35,679
Bullying us common folks!

669
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:37,159
Pay up!

670
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:39,679
Chief Zhao! Chief Zhao!

671
00:40:41,119 --> 00:40:41,559
Chief Zhao!

672
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:44,199
Look,

673
00:40:44,599 --> 00:40:46,840
why barge in without knocking again?

674
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:48,320
Sorry, Chief Zhao.

675
00:40:48,760 --> 00:40:49,239
Something happened.

676
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:51,199
You still need to knock first, no matter what happens.

677
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:58,480
Xiao Qu, as a People's Police officer,

678
00:40:59,119 --> 00:41:01,159
you can't panic like this when things happen.

679
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:02,679
You must stay calm.

680
00:41:02,719 --> 00:41:03,440
You must stay composed.

681
00:41:04,599 --> 00:41:05,199
Yes, sir.

682
00:41:08,199 --> 00:41:08,719
What is it?

683
00:41:10,159 --> 00:41:11,199
Special Police Unit actions at the scene

684
00:41:11,519 --> 00:41:12,559
were taken out of context.

685
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:13,719
This incident

686
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:15,119
has already spread online.

687
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,320
When did this happen?

688
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:19,199
Just today.

689
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:27,000
Chief Liao, we agreed before coming here.

690
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:29,639
No matter how the situation develops,

691
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:32,400
we must not hit or curse back.

692
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:34,840
The safety of the people comes first.

693
00:41:35,639 --> 00:41:36,000
Right?

694
00:41:36,119 --> 00:41:38,000
Those few guys were clearly suspicious.

695
00:41:40,639 --> 00:41:42,800
No calluses on their hands, no dust on their shoes.

696
00:41:42,800 --> 00:41:43,760
They aren't construction workers.

697
00:41:47,119 --> 00:41:48,559
What if they're new workers

698
00:41:49,239 --> 00:41:50,360
who just happened to wear new shoes?

699
00:41:50,360 --> 00:41:52,800
I saw the three of them exchanging looks.

700
00:41:53,679 --> 00:41:55,719
They were teaming up to incite the crowd.

701
00:41:58,440 --> 00:41:59,199
I believe you.

702
00:42:00,079 --> 00:42:00,760
But will others

703
00:42:01,679 --> 00:42:02,760
believe your explanation?

704
00:42:03,239 --> 00:42:04,159
I'm not explaining.

705
00:42:05,079 --> 00:42:06,519
I'm stating the facts.

706
00:42:07,079 --> 00:42:09,480
We must be cautious when maintaining order.

707
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:12,000
Don't let anyone exploit this.

708
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:13,199
I'll take responsibility if anything happens.

709
00:42:13,280 --> 00:42:15,039
This isn't about who takes responsibility.

710
00:42:15,039 --> 00:42:15,679
Then what is it about?

711
00:42:22,679 --> 00:42:23,199
Chief Guo.

712
00:42:23,760 --> 00:42:24,320
Go ahead.

713
00:42:37,639 --> 00:42:38,800
Who else is in his family?

714
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:42,440
He has a younger sister.

715
00:42:43,559 --> 00:42:44,280
She's in college.

716
00:42:50,880 --> 00:42:51,840
Make sure she's taken care of.

717
00:42:53,559 --> 00:42:54,079
Clean it up.

718
00:43:12,039 --> 00:43:14,199
I heard Internal Affairs is investigating.

719
00:43:14,320 --> 00:43:15,000
You have a problem with that?

720
00:43:15,400 --> 00:43:16,599
I really don't feel well.

721
00:43:16,599 --> 00:43:17,719
Where does it hurt?

722
00:43:17,719 --> 00:43:18,840
My chest hurts.

723
00:43:20,039 --> 00:43:20,519
What?

724
00:43:20,880 --> 00:43:22,719
Chief Liao is suspended pending investigation!

725
00:43:22,719 --> 00:43:23,920
This is unfair to Chief Liao.

726
00:43:23,960 --> 00:43:25,199
We can all go testify.

727
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:27,079
Dare to go, and lose your police uniform!

728
00:43:27,880 --> 00:43:28,880
Uncle Liao.

729
00:43:29,519 --> 00:43:31,320
Didn't your sister-in-law find a good backer?

730
00:43:31,320 --> 00:43:32,599
Let's help her test out

731
00:43:32,880 --> 00:43:34,559
whether this backer is truly reliable...

732
00:43:34,639 --> 00:43:35,599
...or not.
